flowchart LR
  ID[Trusted Identity] --> TEN[Tenant]
  TEN --> ROLE[Role]
  ROLE --> PURPOSE[Purpose]
  PURPOSE --> CLASS[Classification]
  CLASS --> AUTH[Governance Authority]
  AUTH --> GRANT[Signed Grant]
  GRANT --> CRYPTO[Signature / Issuer / Binding Checks]
  CRYPTO --> APPROVAL[Approval Validation]
  APPROVAL --> PEP[PEP]
  PEP --> PERM[Tool + Model Permissions]
  PERM --> SAFETY[Budget + Safety]
  SAFETY --> EXEC[Governed Gateway]
